"""KnightWebstudio drawings: the street scene.

Kept apart from emblems.py because it is long. It is one SVG body with
{uid} where an id is needed, so two copies on a page never share an id.
Colours are never written here: every fill is a var(--il-*) from SCENE_PALETTE
in emblems.py, which is how one drawing serves the day and night themes.

STREET  viewBox 0 0 600 640. Back to front: sky, stars, sun or moon, clouds;
        on the horizon the State Capitol tower and the river bridge; pavement
        and road; the street lamp (its glow has class sc-night, lit only after
        dark); the brick shop with shutters, an iron balcony, hanging ferns,
        the painted sign ({sign}), the shop front, the striped awning and a
        planter; the work van at the kerb.
"""

